{"id":"malacopa-tmdb-1720045","type":"MOVIE","category":"CINE","title":"Malacopa","overview":"Un pequeño diablito se distingue en medio de una fiesta de demonios, ya que su pequeña estatura es notable entre tantos cuerpos y diseños singulares. A lo largo de la fiestan, lo único que hace es beber y beber alcohol, comenzando a molestar a todos a su alrededor, hasta que choca por accidente con una demonio y empieza a insultarla de manera exagerada. Ella, por alguna razón, solo habla chino y, mirando a la cámara, dice que ella misma terminará con este berrinche. Acto seguido, lo aplasta, y todos en la fiesta celebran su bien merecida muerte.","releaseDate":"2026-09-02","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fgLzaSZhtJyEG8sTGhtJ66QOhy.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/dBf4QL0yfvnefqf1J5sZTmVw5RZ.jpg","genres":["Comedia","Animación"],"originalLanguage":"es","spokenLanguages":["Spanish","Mandarin"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/dBf4QL0yfvnefqf1J5sZTmVw5RZ.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/bJZVY2tfwMCPBwgHxyO4tqofflK.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/iP4AUnadXTFclZLna0XNThJOsr0.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/quTt1rMDa4W8H6ycDk2sTH5UX5T.jpg","label":"Escena 04"}],"ratings":{},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"Cookie Xia","role":"Diablita Cookie","personTmdbId":6305139,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Márian Monterrubio","role":"Diablito","personTmdbId":6305161,"department":"Acting"}],"crew":[{"name":"Santiago Segu Torres","role":"Director","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZmqEglCGUnauwQWQIXF1IHNIwj.jpg","personTmdbId":5464284,"department":"Directing"},{"name":"Angel Nayar","role":"Producer","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZuL31HYkB0kYzLQOoE4tAyjl8e.jpg","personTmdbId":5886112,"department":"Production"},{"name":"Emmanuel Leyva Ramírez","role":"Post Producer","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AE